  clueId: sf_inspector
  displayTitle: Pinned Above A Bed
  bodyText: It does not hunt the loud ones or the bright ones. It hunts whoever has
    been paying attention. I have watched it walk past three of us to reach the one
    who had been reading. Whatever you do, do not be the one who knows the most -
    and if you are, do not be near anyone when it comes.
